  "createdAt": "2026-05-22",
  "purpose": "Extract SDK pre-run dirty-state checks, post-run scope checks, sdk-write diff allowlist checks, and planned-path preconditions into reusable core while preserving the AE Agent write-runner facade and adapter-owned policy.",
  "decision": {
    "type": "behavior-preserving-extraction",
    "reviewFirstResult": "extractable-with-focused-parity-smoke",
    "rationale": [
      "The target helpers share a narrow contract around pre/post git snapshots, validation result gating, diff allowlists, and planned-path preconditions.",
      "The safety-critical parts are policy inputs: scope validation, forbidden paths, sdk-write planned path allowlists, and the production-code existing-source rule.",
      "The runner facade can inject those policy inputs from the active AE Agent adapter while preserving the public helper exports and existing package command entrypoints."
    ]
  },
